  "oracle_text": "{T}: Add {C}. Put a point counter on this artifact.\nWhenever a creature deals combat damage to you, remove a point counter from this artifact.\nWhenever a creature you control deals combat damage to an opponent, put a point counter on this artifact. Then if it has ten or more point counters on it, remove them all and that player loses the game."
